as in table rates and totals.\n\nLook at the parser code that converts the raw text lines into table items (e.g. `parseLineItems` or the regex that extracts price/rate):\n\n1. FIX THE REGEX & COMMA SPLIT:\n   Whenever extracting\n<truncated 13916 bytes>\nll')`.\n   - Launch `./venv/bin/python3 server.py 3000` as daemon (`IsDaemon: true`).\n2. **Run Final Verification Test**:\n   - Run a test script verifying that:\n     1. Text `CGST @ 9%: 990.00` and `SGST @ 9%: 990.00` parses to `cgst: 990.0`, `sgst: 990.0`.\n     2. Text with stray `2` like `2. SGST @ 9%: 990.00` or `CGST @ 9% 2 990.00` parses to `990.0` (not `2990.0`).\n     3. An invoice with subtotal ₹11,000 and 18% intra-state has Verified Total ₹12,980.00.\n3. **Notify User**:\n   - Deliver clear summary confirming the resolution of the `2990` bug, the deterministic `subtotal * 0.09` tax formula, and the updated quick buttons with clickable `file://` links.\n\n---\n\n### 7. Commitments & Constraints\n- Keep all existing UI layout, Section 44AD ITR-4 insights, and table controls untouched.\n- Preserve clickable `file://` links for all file references.\n- Never calculate tax as `(Billed Total - Subtotal)`. Calculate strictly as `subtotal * (rate_percentage / 100)`.\n</summary>\n\n# Running Background Tasks\nThe following background tasks were running at the time this checkpoint was created.\nUse the manage_task tool to interact with them (e.g. to kill them or check their status).\n\n{\n  \"taskId\":  \"f7fe8eca-ba38-4dcb-97a7-a40aeb890237/task-1704\",\n  \"toolName\":  \"run_command\",\n  \"toolSummary\":  \"Restart FastAPI server on port 3000\",\n  \"description\":  \"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/venv/bin/python3 /Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/server.py 3000\",\n  \"startTime\":  \"2026-11-02T19:57:37.399450Z\",\n  \"stepIndex\":  1704,\n  \"logUri\":  \"file:///Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/brain/f7fe8eca-ba38-4dcb-97a7-a40aeb890237/.system_generated/task